~ start

[speed=0.9]My feet... aren't touching the floor.[/speed]

[speed=0.8][wave amp=2 freq=2]I'm floating.[/wave][/speed]

[speed=0.8]...Am I dreaming?[/speed]

#[Cue Birthday Party Ambience]

[speed=1.0]Wait...[/speed]

[speed=1.0][wave amp=1 freq=2]Everyone's here.[/wave][/speed]

[speed=1.0][wave amp=2 freq=3]Everyone's calling my name![/wave][/speed]

#[Pili beams as she holds up a container of orange juice.]

[speed=0.9]Nanay is smiling.[/speed]

#[Valerie gently bounces Kiki, who giggles and reaches for a floating balloon. Dodong grins as he shows Noni his Game Boy screen.]

[speed=0.9]My siblings aren't fighting.[/speed]

#[Ernesto smiles as he adjusts the pabitin.]

[speed=0.9]Tatay isn't tired.[/speed]

#[Ritchie laughs with chocolate frosting on his chin, clutching a plastic loot bag.]

[speed=1.0][wave amp=1 freq=2]Even the sky looks happy today.[/wave][/speed]

#[Cue Raw and Authentic Birthday Song]

EVERYONE: [speed=1.0][wave amp=1 freq=2]Happy birthday, Ollie![/wave][/speed]

[speed=0.8]Everything's moving so slowly...[/speed]

[speed=0.9]But I'm not scared.[/speed]

[speed=0.9]I feel warm.[/speed]

[speed=1.0]I feel happy.[/speed]

PILI: [speed=1.0]Blow out the candles, anak! Make a wish![/speed]

[speed=0.9]A wish?[/speed]

[speed=0.9]What should I wish for?[/speed]

[speed=1.0][wave amp=2 freq=3]Oh! I know![/wave][/speed]

[speed=0.8][b]I wish this party could happen for real![/b][/speed]

[speed=0.7]...[/speed]

[speed=0.8]If this is what turning eight feels like...[/speed]

[speed=0.8]I don't need anything else.[/speed]

[speed=0.7]I just want to stay here.[/speed]

[speed=0.6][b]With everyone.[/b][/speed]

[speed=0.5][shake rate=2 level=2][b]Forever and ever.[/b][/shake][/speed]

#[Ollie smiles and blows out the candles.]

